WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.871
Step 1. Open the update form. To record that a patient has died,

1.2
00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:09.631
open the patient's profile and select Edit in General Info.

2.1
00:00:09.631 --> 00:00:12.474
Step 2. Find the Deceased Status box.

2.2
00:00:12.474 --> 00:00:16.618
It is in the Additional Details section of the form.

3.1
00:00:16.618 --> 00:00:21.457
Step 3. Mark the patient as deceased. Tick Mark as deceased.

3.2
00:00:21.457 --> 00:00:25.704
Care then shows the Date and Time of Death field.

4.1
00:00:25.704 --> 00:00:31.361
Step 4. Enter the date and time of death. Check it before you select Update.

4.2
00:00:31.361 --> 00:00:37.125
If you later untick Mark as deceased and save, the patient stays deceased.

5.1
00:00:37.125 --> 00:00:40.021
Step 5. Save the change. Select Update.

5.2
00:00:40.021 --> 00:00:45.516
The header of the profile then shows a red banner with the Deceased badge and the

5.3
00:00:45.516 --> 00:00:47.577
date and time of death.
